text:
Occasion is the time of day in which the story takes place, the season of year, or even a specific holiday. In "A Sound of Thunder," you will have to think of an occasion that fits the setting well - it must be something different than what we read about at school. You can use one of these, or invent your own based on your imagination!

You may wish to choose:

* Thanksgiving dinner, with all of the family gathered around the table;
* Christmas morning, when children eagerly await their presents from Santa Claus;
